    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani namichi ammalle naabo alaati na geese, mana toko ka Mana Waaqa moga mirga jiruni na d'ufe, ka mana Mana Waaqatini ila adu ira fago intahini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana kana, d'eerinni isaa d'und'uma d'ibba tokoti, ballinnileeni shantama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moga tokooni mani suni lafa akanumati hafte taani ta ballinni isii d'und'uma diddama, ta d'aatu Mana Waaqati, fuula deefata. Ammalle moga tokooni d'akha qaarisani naabo ala garaa keesani marsaniti fuula deefata. Mana kana aka faano woljalaa bubuusani wolgubbati jaarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana kana gama mirga, karaati jira; ballinni kara suni d'und'uma kud'ani, d'eerinnileeni d'und'uma d'ibba toko, ka balbalti seenaniini gama suni jirtu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maneeni gubbati jaarani taani maneeni jiddu keesatifi ta jalale ira didiqo; wonti akanatiifi maneeni suni aka faano woljalaa bubuusani jaarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maneeni aka faano woljalaa bubutu tunini ch'ufti haguma geetunu, ka utuba aka maneeni naabo keesa ejaanjitu kaani inqamne, wolgubba ejaanjiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Girgidaani mana suni, gama jalaatini, haga d'und'uma shantama duuda d'iibu tokole inqabu. Ammo d'und'umi shantama ka hafe kaani d'iibu qaba. Mana gubbaa aanu, haga d'eerinni isaa gahu ch'ufa d'iibuti jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7+EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7",
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'iibu tana jala, maneeni moga ilaboru, fulla girgidaani manatini eju, balbalati, jira, ta naabo alaati baasiftu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Waaqatini, moga bita, mana d'ibiti jira, ka mana sunini wolfakaatu, ka ammalle mana Mana Waaqatini ila adu eju kaani ira fago intahini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'iibu tana dura karaati jira, ka kara moga mirga kaani fakaatu. Kara kanafi kara kaanile biimani isaa takuma, balbalti inni seenunileeni haguma taka, ammalle waan ch'ufaani woli fakaata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balbala tokoti jira, ta balbala taani d'ibi gama bitaatini jalati jaarani, fulla manani moga ilaboru ta girgidaani manatini eju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi waan nani jed'e, Maneeni tunini lachu qulqullo. Maneeni tana keesati qaaloleeni Waaqa dura d'uftu sorio ch'ufa ira qulqullo nyaati. Waan d'iibuni tunini qulqullo taateefi qaaloleeni sorio ch'ufa ira qulqullo taani achi keesati olkeeti: mid'aani Waaqa baasanifi sorio dabaani ufi ira baasanifi yokhaani waan gati sorio baasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo qaaloleeni eegi qara Mana Waaqa duude ammalle keesaa baate gara naabo ala d'aqu feete, worri woya qulqullo, ta AABBO Waaqa duraani hojattu, d'iibu tana keesati lakisu male, Worri woya d'iibi keeyachu male ato fulla biyyiti iti wolwoldeetu ind'umne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biima qaye Mana Waaqa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi kaani Mana Waaqatifi naabo isatifi mana arti keesa jiru ch'ufa biime keesaa baanaani balbala ilaborutini gadi naa baase ammalle qaye suni ch'ufa biime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni ule woini biimu taani fuud'e, moga ilaboru biime, biimani isii d'und'uma d'ibba shani taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni moga mirgaatifi ta bitaatifi ta ila adule biime; biimani moga suni ch'ufti haga taka, d'und'uma d'ibba shaniti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17+EZK.42.18+EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17",
              "EZK.42.18",
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akanaani naabo qaye sunini marsani, biimani isii ta moga ch'ufa, d'und'uma d'ibba shani taate. Naaboni tunini waan qulqulloofi ka qulqullo intahini gargari baafti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka AABBO Waaqi Mana ufiti deebie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
